{"seq":3,"slug":"bidirectional-virtualization","title":"双向虚拟化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/advanced/bidirectional-virtualization","wordCount":1308,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"双向虚拟化\">双向虚拟化</h1><p><a href=\"infinite-scroll-paging\">无限滚动与分页</a> 留了一句话：向下追加不跳动，向上追加必然跳动。聊天窗口、活动时间线、日志查看器恰恰是「向上加载历史」的重灾区——你打开聊天停在最新一条，向上滚去看旧消息，列表顶部不断插入更早的内容。每一次顶部插入都会把下方所有内容向下推，你正读的那条消息瞬间消失。这一篇专讲双向虚拟化：如何在两个方向都能加载、且在顶部插入时主动补偿滚动位置，让用户毫无察觉。它是 <a href=\"../mechanics/scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a> 在 prepend 方向上的极端情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-prepend-必然跳动\">核心概念：为什么 prepend 必然跳动</h2><p><code>scrollTop</code> 是「内容顶部到当前视口顶部的距离」，是个绝对值。当你在列表<strong>最前面</strong>插入一批高度共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的新行，这批行占据了从 0 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的空间，原来所有内容整体下移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。但浏览器不会自动改 <code>scrollTop</code>——它仍是插入前的值，于是视口里显示的内容，从「你正读的那条」变成了「往上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 像素处的内容」。视觉效果就是内容猛地往下窜了一大截。</p>\n<p>append（向下追加）则相反：新行加在末尾，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H+\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 区间里任何已有行的偏移，<code>scrollTop</code> 不变也正确。这就是为什么常规无限滚动只敢向下。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[聊天停在最新,向上滚看历史] --&gt; B[顶部哨兵进入视口]&#10;  B --&gt; C[加载更早的一批消息,总高 delta]&#10;  C --&gt; D[prepend:插到数组最前,所有旧行偏移 +delta]&#10;  D --&gt; E{是否补偿 scrollTop?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[内容下窜 delta,正读消息消失,体验崩坏]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[scrollTop += delta,视觉锚点不动]&#10;  G --&gt; H[用户继续平滑向上浏览]\">flowchart TD\n  A[聊天停在最新,向上滚看历史] --&gt; B[顶部哨兵进入视口]\n  B --&gt; C[加载更早的一批消息,总高 delta]\n  C --&gt; D[prepend:插到数组最前,所有旧行偏移 +delta]\n  D --&gt; E{是否补偿 scrollTop?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[内容下窜 delta,正读消息消失,体验崩坏]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[scrollTop += delta,视觉锚点不动]\n  G --&gt; H[用户继续平滑向上浏览]</pre><h2 id=\"核心解法-prepend-后立即补偿\">核心解法：prepend 后立即补偿</h2><p>解法和机制章的锚定同源：插入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 高度，就给 <code>scrollTop</code> 加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，把下窜抵消掉。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>新插入行</mtext></munder><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{scrollTop}_\\text{new} = \\text{scrollTop}_\\text{old} + \\Delta,\\quad \\Delta = \\sum_{\\text{新插入行}} h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">新插入行</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但这里有一个比普通锚定更棘手的点：<strong>新插入行的高度往往是未知变高</strong>，prepend 那一刻你只有估算值，真实高度要等渲染后测量。于是补偿要分两步：先按估算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 补一次，等 <code>ResizeObserver</code> 量出真实高度后，再补上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_\\text{real} - \\hat{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的差值。两步都必须在绘制前完成，否则用户会看到两次窜动。这把 <a href=\"../mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a> 的「绘制前收敛」要求推到了极致。</p>\n<p>落地的稳健做法是锚定一个具体元素而非纯数字：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>prepend 前，记下当前视口顶部第一个可见行的 id 与它距视口顶的偏移 <code>offsetInViewport</code>。</li>\n<li>prepend、渲染、测量完成后，重新查这个锚点行的新偏移 <code>newOffset</code>，令 <code>scrollTop = newOffset - offsetInViewport</code>。</li>\n<li>这样无论中间高度怎么变，锚点行在屏幕上的位置永远不变——比累加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 更抗误差。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"双向哨兵与方向判定\">双向哨兵与方向判定</h2><p>双向虚拟化在顶部和底部各放一个哨兵，但要避免两个陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>加载抖动</strong>：补偿后哨兵可能仍在触发范围内，导致连续触发加载。补偿到位后要等哨兵真正离开 <code>rootMargin</code> 才允许下次触发，并加 <code>isFetching</code> 锁。</li>\n<li><strong>方向冲突</strong>：用户快速来回滚，顶部和底部哨兵可能同时命中。要按滚动方向（比较前后 <code>scrollTop</code>）决定优先加载哪一端，避免双向同时 prepend/append 把尺寸模型搅乱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下表对比三种列表形态在两个方向上的行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>初始位置</th>\n<th>主加载方向</th>\n<th>补偿需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通信息流</td>\n<td>顶部</td>\n<td>向下 append</td>\n<td>无需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聊天/IM</td>\n<td>底部（最新）</td>\n<td>向上 prepend</td>\n<td>强需要，每次 prepend 补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向时间线</td>\n<td>中间某锚点</td>\n<td>两个方向</td>\n<td>两端都可能，按方向判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反向列表与-贴底\">反向列表与「贴底」</h2><p>聊天还有个特殊需求：新消息到达时要自动滚到底（贴底），但只有当用户<strong>本来就在底部</strong>时才贴——用户正翻历史时来了新消息，不该把他拽到底。实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>维护一个 <code>isAtBottom</code> 标志（<code>scrollTop + viewportH &gt;= totalHeight - tolerance</code>）。</li>\n<li>新消息 append 后，仅当 <code>isAtBottom</code> 为真时才 <code>scrollToBottom()</code>，否则只显示一个「N 条新消息」提示。</li>\n<li>用 CSS <code>flex-direction: column-reverse</code> 实现「内容从底部往上堆」的视觉，能让浏览器原生维持贴底，但它与虚拟化的窗口计算、与 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 都有微妙交互，需谨慎测试（兼容性见 <a href=\"../mechanics/scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a> 里对 Safari 不支持 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 的提醒）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些「贴底/不贴底」「新消息提示」的逻辑，正是 react-virtuoso 这类库主打的 <code>Virtuoso</code> 反向模式所封装的能力，选型时若做 IM 应优先看这块支持（见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>prepend（顶部插入）必然让下方内容下窜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，因为 <code>scrollTop</code> 是绝对值不会自动调整；append 则天然安全。</li>\n<li>解法是插入后立即把 <code>scrollTop</code> 加上插入高度；变高场景要分两步补偿（估算补 + 测量差值补），且都在绘制前完成；更稳健的是锚定一个具体行 id 而非累加数字。</li>\n<li>双向哨兵要防加载抖动（补偿后加锁、等哨兵离开）与方向冲突（按滚动方向判优先端）。</li>\n<li>聊天需「仅当用户在底部时才贴底」的逻辑与新消息提示；<code>column-reverse</code> 可辅助贴底但与虚拟化/<code>overflow-anchor</code> 有微妙交互，IM 场景优先选支持反向模式的库。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>补偿的通用机制：<a href=\"../mechanics/scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a></li>\n<li>触底加载与哨兵：<a href=\"infinite-scroll-paging\">无限滚动与分页</a></li>\n<li>两步补偿依赖的测量：<a href=\"../mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a></li>\n<li>IM 选哪个库：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a></li>\n<li>跨库——实时消息推送：<a href=\"../../frontend-data-fetching/patterns/optimistic-updates\">乐观更新</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"双向虚拟化","id":"双向虚拟化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么 prepend 必然跳动","id":"核心概念-为什么-prepend-必然跳动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心解法：prepend 后立即补偿","id":"核心解法-prepend-后立即补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"双向哨兵与方向判定","id":"双向哨兵与方向判定"},{"level":2,"text":"反向列表与「贴底」","id":"反向列表与-贴底"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"无限滚动与分页","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/advanced/infinite-scroll-paging"},"next":{"title":"虚拟化库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/practice/virtualization-libraries"}}